Mixer for Colugo Y H-Frame VTOL (SITL)
=========================================================

This file defines mixers for Colugo Y H-Frame VTOL (SITL gazebo).
The first 4 outputs are H-frame motors (handled by control allocator).
The plane has two ailerons, one elevator, and one rudder.

R: 4h

# mixer for the pusher/puller throttle
M: 1
O:      10000  10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 3      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

# mixer for the left aileron
M: 2
S: 1 0  -10000  -10000   0 -10000  10000
S: 1 4  -10000  -10000	0 -10000  10000

# mixer for the right aileron
M: 2
S: 1 0  10000  10000    0 -10000  10000
S: 1 4  -10000  -10000	0 -10000  10000

# mixer for the elevator
M: 1
O:       10000   10000   0 -10000  10000
S: 1 1   10000   10000    0 -10000  10000

#colugo actuator
M: 1
O:       10000   10000   0 -10000  10000
S: 6 6   10000   10000    0 -10000  10000
